OL,3,GNEWSACouncil asks public not to
OL,4,Aspeculate over fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham Council has asked the public
OL,7,Fnot to speculate over the cause of a
OL,8,Ffire which scorched a row of houses
OL,9,Flast month.
OL,11,FFlames swept across parts of the West
OL,12,FMidlands during a spell of hot weather
OL,13,Fon 13 August, with Gorleston Road,
OL,14,FWarstock, among the affected areas. The
OL,15,Ffire devastated several back gardens,
OL,16,Fwhile six homes remain fenced off.
OL,18,FFollowing the blaze, the council said
OL,19,Fit was committed to mitigating future
OL,20,Ffire risks while also "safeguarding
OL,21,Fbiodiversity and the wider natural
OL,22,Fenvironment".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
