OL,3,GNEWSACouncil asks public not to
OL,4,Aspeculate over fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have spoken about the scenes
OL,7,Fthey witnessed and the deep shock that
OL,8,Ffollowed, with one woman saying it was
OL,9,Fa "miracle" they still had a house.
